@page "/Settings/System"
@model SystemSettingsModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "System settings";

    var emailUrl = Url.Page("SystemSettings", "Email");
    var mainUrl = Url.Page("SystemSettings", "Main");
}
@*
    The URL is /Settings/System, set by the route above rather than by the file name. A Razor Page
    called System.cshtml would compile to a class called System inside Techie.Pbx.Web.Pages.Settings,
    which then shadows the System namespace for everything else in that namespace — so the file is
    named for its model and the route says what an admin types.
*@

<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
    <h1 class="h3 mb-0">System settings</h1>
</div>

<p class="text-secondary">
    The settings about this box rather than about calls (D115). They are the same settings the
    <a asp-page="/Settings/Index">general settings page</a> lists, and they are edited the same way:
    click a row. None of them is written into Asterisk's config, so none of them needs an apply.
</p>

@*
    Bootstrap's own tabs. Each pane fetches its own contents and refreshes on settingsChanged, the
    same way the SIP page's single table does — so saving a setting in the modal updates the tab
    behind it, whichever tab that was.
*@
<ul class="nav nav-tabs" id="system-tabs" role="tablist">
    <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
        <button class="nav-link active" id="main-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#main-pane"
                type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="main-pane" aria-selected="true">Main</button>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item" role="presentation">
        <button class="nav-link" id="email-tab" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#email-pane"
                type="button" role="tab" aria-controls="email-pane" aria-selected="false">Email</button>
    </li>
</ul>

<div class="tab-content pt-3">
    <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="main-pane" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="main-tab"
         hx-get="@mainUrl" hx-trigger="load, settingsChanged from:body">
        <p class="text-secondary">Loading…</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="email-pane" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="email-tab"
         hx-get="@emailUrl" hx-trigger="load, settingsChanged from:body">
        <p class="text-secondary">Loading…</p>
    </div>
</div>

<partial name="_FormModal" />
